title: "Multi-CAPTCHA (REDCap External Module)"
abstract: "A REDCap External Module that protects public surveys with a pluggable bot-check provider (Cloudflare Turnstile, Google reCAPTCHA v3, hCaptcha, Friendly Captcha, or mCaptcha), configurable globally or per project."
